planned."}, {"beat": 164, "text": "Maybe I\u2019m odd, but I can\u2019t reconcile,"}, {"beat": 172, "text": "Clowns aren\u2019t my thing; I prefer wooden puppets\u2019 smile."}, {"beat": 180, "text": "[ solo ]"}, {"beat": 212, "text": "I don\u2019t like clowns, they\u2019re not my cup of tea,"}, {"beat": 220, "text": "Their silly jokes always make me grumble, you see."}, {"beat": 228, "text": "Let them stay in their circus, I don\u2019t want to cheer,"}, {"beat": 236, "text": "Clowns aren\u2019t for me, I\u2019d rather have pastries near."}, {"beat": 244, "text": "[outro]"}, {"beat": 252, "text": ""}]}}}